# Files excluded from Docker build contexts.
#
# Goals:
#   1. Never bake .env files / secrets into images.
#   2. Never ship local node_modules / build outputs (the Dockerfile rebuilds them).
#   3. Never ship user-generated data (uploads, reports, backups, the local DB volume).
#   4. Keep the build context small so transfers to the daemon stay fast.

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- VCS / metadata --------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.dockerignore
.github
.gitlab-ci.yml
**/.git

# --- Build tooling files we don't need inside the image --------------------
# The Dockerfiles themselves are read by `docker build` BEFORE this list takes
# effect, so excluding them here is safe and shrinks the context.
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
**/Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile.*
docker-compose*.yml
**/docker-compose*.yml

# --- Node ------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules
**/node_modules
npm-debug.log
**/npm-debug.log
yarn-error.log
**/yarn-error.log
.pnpm-store
.npm

# --- Build outputs (rebuilt inside Docker) --------------------------------
backend/dist
frontend/dist
backend/generated
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/.next

# --- Runtime / user data ---------------------------------------------------
backend/uploads
backend/reports
backend/backups

# --- Editor / OS -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode
.idea
.cursor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
**/*.log
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Tests / docs / tooling that the runtime image doesn't need -----------
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/__snapshots__
**/__tests__
docs
*.md
**/*.md
!backend/prisma/migrations/**/*.sql
LICENSE
LICENSE.*
NOTICE
NOTICE.*

# --- CI/IDE config that isn't useful at runtime ---------------------------
.editorconfig
.prettierrc*
.eslintrc*
**/.prettierrc*
**/.eslintrc*
